    "created_at": "2026-10-09T06:26:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-09T06:26:50Z",
    "body": "@asutherland heya, it would be best to open a new issue to track this properly. But one thing to keep in mind is that `new Notification()` can be used outside of a service worker context as well.\r\n\r\nAs for non-subresource request, I thought that was for cases such as \"report\" and top-level worker fetches, none of which are navigations. It never really included notification icons in my mind.",
